{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114719","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114719/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114719/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114719/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114719","id":3791121411,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7h9-wD","number":114719,"title":"apply_impulse() does not take mass into account when applying directly after instantiating","user":{"login":"fakemaxwell","id":59422275,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDIyMjc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59422275?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell","html_url":"https://github.com/fakemaxwell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-08T03:54:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T11:19:12Z","closed_at":"2026-01-08T11:19:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700K (28 threads) - 31.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen instantiating a rigidbody scene and applying an impulse to it, the mass of the object is not taken into account unless await get_tree().physics_frame is used (or manually dividing the impulse by instantiated_rigidbody.mass).\n\nI would expect the impulse calculation to take the mass of the body into account, regardless of when apply_impulse() is called.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn the MRP, there are 2 permanent balls and 2 instantiated balls. Press Q and W to apply an impulse of Vector2(0, -300) to balls weighing 1.0kg and 0.5kg, respectively. The lighter ball travels higher with the same impulse.\n\nPress E to instantiate a ball weighing 0.5kg and apply an impulse of  Vector2(0, -300).  The impulse awaits a physics frame before applying.  It matches the W ball.\n\nPress R to instantiate a ball weighing 0.5kg and apply an impulse of  Vector2(0, -300).  This impulse is applied immediately.  This ball travels half the height it should, matching the Q ball (weight of 1.0kg).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[impulse-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24486831/impulse-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114719/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}